Things peculiar to the off-line testing (grep for PJT in the conf file)

- port 6380   # redis and the real online likely already use 6379)
- dir  ./     # current directory for the rdb file, so launch from here
- dbfilename sma-shared-variables.rdb

After installing valkey start server in this directory

      valkey-server valkey_sma.conf

Query using the valkey-cli program:

      valkey-cli
      > ping
      PONG
      > keys *
      DSM:roach2-48:SWARM_SCAN_X
      ...
      1041) "DSM:phasemon:PHASEMON_HRDWR_STAT_X"

or

      valkey-cli keys \*   > keys.log
      

